  <h2 id="h-where" class="sec">Where we can win</h2>
  <p class="sub">PlayWorld scores four task families. Genie 3 is strong on geometry and control but weak when something leaves the frame or has to change over time. Inference-time memory and state tracking should help most on those two families, so most of our work targets them. Bars start at 1, the score floor. "Ours" is a single run, the same one as on the ruler above, not a per-family best across runs. It is hatched while that run covers only part of the benchmark.</p>
